The questionnaire items bundled in dist/ (from OEJTS 1.2) are NOT covered by
the MIT license above; they are licensed as follows.

---

The questionnaire items in this directory are taken from the
Open Extended Jungian Type Scales 1.2 by Eric Jorgenson
(https://openpsychometrics.org/tests/OJTS/development/OEJTS1.2.pdf).

They are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).

The OEJTS comes with no guarantees of reliability or accuracy of any kind.
This project is not affiliated with the Myers-Briggs Type Indicator or
The Myers-Briggs Company.

Changes: the items were transcribed into JSON; the scoring formulas from the
original PDF were rewritten as a per-item sign ("sign": 1 means the right-hand
description points toward the positive pole E/N/T/P). Item wording is unchanged.
